1063+ 8345                  ; DeltaX >= 0:
1064+ 8345 FE 09            cp   9
1065+ 8347 30 0E            jr   nc, .shift_dx_gt_8        ; DeltaX in [9..15]
1066+ 8349
1067+ 8349                  ; DeltaX in [0..8]: shift a sinistra a 16 bit (D, E) per DeltaX volte
