 491+ 866F E1               pop  hl
 492+ 8670 D1               pop  de
 493+ 8671 C1               pop  bc
 494+ 8672 37               scf
 495+ 8673 C9               ret
 496+ 8674
 497+ 8674              .no_collision:
 498+ 8674 E1               pop  hl
 499+ 8675 D1               pop  de
 500+ 8676 C1               pop  bc
 501+ 8677 B7               or   a
 502+ 8678 C9               ret
